<header class="ws-head"><p class="ws-kicker">Worksheet &middot; History by century</p><h1 class="ws-title">Worksheet: The 7th century BCE</h1><p class="ws-lede">A worksheet on the 600s BCE: the states, events and people of the century. Use its page to find the answers.</p><p class="ws-who" aria-hidden="true"><span>Name</span><span>Class</span><span>Date</span></p><p class="ws-tools"><button type="button" class="ws-print" data-key="0">Print the worksheet</button><button type="button" class="ws-print" data-key="1">Print with the answers</button><a href="/centuries/7th-century-bce">Open the century page &rarr;</a></p></header>
<section class="ws-task"><h2><span class="ws-n">1</span>Name the states on the map</h2><p class="ws-how">Each number marks the capital or seat of a state that existed in 650 BCE. Write its name from the word bank on the line with the same number.</p><figure class="ws-mapfig"><svg class="map map-world ws-map" viewBox="0 0 10519 5536" role="img" aria-label="Map: 6 numbered states of the world in 650 BCE"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><g class="ws-pins"><g><circle cx="6092" cy="1134" r="179"/><text x="6092" y="1209" font-size="215">1</text></g><g><circle cx="7768" cy="1187" r="179"/><text x="7768" y="1262" font-size="215">2</text></g><g><circle cx="6237" cy="1859" r="179"/><text x="6237" y="1934" font-size="215">3</text></g><g><circle cx="5591" cy="1068" r="179"/><text x="5591" y="1143" font-size="215">4</text></g><g><circle cx="2871" cy="2792" r="179"/><text x="2871" y="2867" font-size="215">5</text></g><g><circle cx="7155" cy="1425" r="179"/><text x="7155" y="1500" font-size="215">6</text></g></g></svg><figcaption>The world in 650 BCE</figcaption></figure><p class="ws-bank"><b>Word bank:</b> Assyrian Empire &middot; State of Qin &middot; Chavín &middot; Athens &middot; Kingdom of Saba &middot; Kingdom of Kosala</p><ol class="ws-blanks"><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li></ol></section>
<section class="ws-task"><h2><span class="ws-n">2</span>Put the events in order</h2><p class="ws-how">Number the events from 1 (earliest) to 6 (latest).</p><ul class="ws-order"><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Battle of Chengpu</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Fall of Nineveh</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Fall of Harran</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Battle of Carchemish</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Assyrian conquest of Egypt</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Medo-Babylonian conquest of the Assyrian Empire</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="ws-task"><h2><span class="ws-n">3</span>Think and discuss</h2><ol class="ws-qs"><li><p>In the 600s BCE, 81 recorded states were founded and 32 came to an end. Choose one of each from the century page. What happened to them?</p><span class="ws-lines" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></li><li><p>The great powers of the age included the Assyrian Empire, the State of Qin and the State of Chu. Choose one: what made it strong in these hundred years, and what threatened it?</p><span class="ws-lines" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></li><li><p>If you could visit one place in the 7th century BCE, where would you go, and what would you hope to see?</p><span class="ws-lines" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></li></ol></section>
<p class="ws-src">From The Epoch Institute: the-epoch-institute.org/centuries/7th-century-bce. Free to print and copy for use in class.</p>
<details class="ws-key" id="answers"><summary>Answer key</summary><div class="ws-key-b"><p class="ws-key-t">Answer key: Worksheet: The 7th century BCE</p><section><h2><span class="ws-n">1</span>Name the states on the map</h2><ol class="ws-key-list"><li>Assyrian Empire <span>2025 BCE – 609 BCE</span></li><li>State of Qin <span>897 BCE – 221 BCE</span></li><li>Kingdom of Saba <span>800 BCE – 275 CE</span></li><li>Athens <span>900 BCE – 86 BCE</span></li><li>Chavín <span>950 BCE – 400 BCE</span></li><li>Kingdom of Kosala <span>700 BCE – 460 BCE</span></li></ol></section><section><h2><span class="ws-n">2</span>Put the events in order</h2><ol class="ws-key-list"><li>Assyrian conquest of Egypt <span>671 BCE</span></li><li>Battle of Chengpu <span>632 BCE</span></li><li>Medo-Babylonian conquest of the Assyrian Empire <span>626–609 BCE</span></li><li>Fall of Nineveh <span>612 BCE</span></li><li>Fall of Harran <span>609 BCE</span></li><li>Battle of Carchemish <span>605 BCE</span></li></ol></section><section><h2><span class="ws-n">3</span>Think and discuss</h2><p class="ws-key-note">Open questions: answers will vary. Good answers name states, people and events from the century page.</p></section></div></details>
